# Public API compatibility baseline: 0.26.0 (the last published release; the next release is checked
# against it). Add exclusions here only for intentional removals, with a comment explaining each.
# After a release is published: raise the baseline in .github/workflows/api-compatibility.yml to that
# version and delete the exclusions below, which then describe changes the baseline already contains.
# ExcelConditionalRule.dataBar(ExcelColor, ExcelColor) removed: it wrote a second <color> element, which the
# OOXML schema does not allow, and Excel's data bars have no two-color gradient.
io.github.dornol.excelkit.excel.ExcelConditionalRule#dataBar(io.github.dornol.excelkit.excel.ExcelColor,io.github.dornol.excelkit.excel.ExcelColor)
